{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04436","headline":"登蓟丘楼送贾兵曹入都 · 陈子昂","name":"登蓟丘楼送贾兵曹入都","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东山宿昔意，北征非我心。\n孤负平生愿，感涕下沾襟。\n暮登蓟楼上，永望燕山岑。\n辽海方漫漫，胡沙飞且深。\n峨眉杳如梦，仙子曷由寻。\n击劒起叹息，白日忽西沈。\n闻君洛阳使，因子寄南音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04436.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04436","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}